  "2026-11-16T11:02:04.515Z",codex-sol,"Initial review receipt: the failed workflow log and current pin are documented in docs/issue-sync-2026-11-16.md. Seeded tracker validation passes through pm test --run --progress. Rust cargo check and fmt pass; clippy and package tests remain running. The strict-create synthetic reproduction fails as expected; importer repair remains upstream.   Publish review evidence with pending gates explicit; no scheduled success is claimed."
  "2026-11-16T11:05:23.158Z",codex-sol,"Run 43828004648 fails strict-create admission: Missing required options --acceptance-criteria/--ac, --assignee, --comment, --deadline, --dep, --doc, --estimate/--estimated-minutes, --file, --learning, --note, --priority, --test for type Issue. Reproduced exit 2 with the locked 2026.11.11 oracle in a synthetic strict tracker. pm-github 2026.11.15 buildAtomicImportMutations omits those fields and empty-collection assertions; import exposes no caller create-mode, template or default-field options. Fix belongs upstream in pm-github. Strict tracker governance is preserved; no importer patch or GitHub issue mutation is applied."
